By virtue of and pursuant to the au­
thority vested in me by the act of June“  
16, 1933, c. 90, 48 Stat. 195, 200-202, and  
as President of the United States, it is  
ordered that the jurisdiction and control  
over the following lands on the Island of  
St. Croix, Virgin Islands, constituting  
a part of that tract commonly known as  
“Bethlehem Estates” and indicated by  
hachures on the attached plat of the  
“Site of Proposed Auxiliary Airdrome,”  
prepared by the War Department and  
bearing the date June, 1940,1  be, and the  
same are hereby, transferred from the  
Department of the Interior to the War  
Department for national-defense pur­poses: :
